OL,5,G0306FOutlook
OL,6,     GIn 1986 Beverly Glenn-Copeland
OL,7,     Gmade an experimental album in a
OL,8,     Gremote Canadian cabin. A few
OL,9,     Gcopies were sold and it was
OL,10,     Galmost forgotten - until 30 years
OL,11,     Glater it became a cult hit.
OL,12,G0350FWitness History
OL,13,     GIn 1960, the King of Rock 'n'
OL,14,     GRoll made an unexpected stop at
OL,15,     GPrestwick Airport. It's believed
OL,16,     Gto be the only time Elvis Presley
OL,17,     Gset foot on British soil.
